                                "sense_id": "3655b247-06df-3ed7-a254-7c8eaa08cd99",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: automobilery, motordom"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d728de1a-feb8-465d-a748-39eba1910506",
                                "sense_id": "3655b247-06df-3ed7-a254-7c8eaa08cd99",
                                "text": "In view of the fact that a number of paradigm shifts are required to bring about the authors' vision of sustainable automobility - paradigm shifts in the way cars are made, sold, used and powered - this approach appears inadequate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad6d565c-b158-42ec-8225-7785930ddf47",
                                "sense_id": "3655b247-06df-3ed7-a254-7c8eaa08cd99",
                                "text": "eMobility is not only an alternative drive technology that can be substituted for the combustion engine that has dominated until now, it could revolutionize transport altogether because it differs decisively from conventional automobility."
